Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.79,0:01:47.42,Main,Thunder Soldier,0,0,0,,接下來我們要走地下通道，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.42,0:01:49.02,Main,Thunder Soldier,0,0,0,,潛入敵方的交易港！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.02,0:01:52.62,Main,Leo,0,0,0,,我們的目標是一個小女孩。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.84,0:01:55.43,Main,Leo,0,0,0,,砂糖！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.43,0:01:58.41,Main,Flapper,0,0,0,,別看她個子小，她可不是好對付的！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.41,0:02:03.54,Main,Leo,0,0,0,,我們要把砂糖擊昏，讓這個國家所有的玩具都變回人類！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.66,0:02:15.25,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,好擠啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.25,0:02:18.45,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,我跟羅賓蘭勉強才擠得進去。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.45,0:02:23.14,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,佛朗蘭，你最好先把肩膀和手臂卸下來。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.59,0:02:24.76,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,我才不要！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.78,0:02:29.90,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,喂，那條隧道對我蘭來說也太小了。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.28,0:02:35.05,Main,Leo,0,0,0,,我們可沒想過會有大人類要用它。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.05,0:02:37.00,Main,Thunder Soldier,0,0,0,,你只能從玩具屋進去了。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.52,0:02:41.87,Main,Thunder Soldier,0,0,0,,玩具屋就在王宮高地的下方。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.87,0:02:46.07,Main,Thunder Soldier,0,0,0,,那是玩具們每天晚上都會去的地方。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.07,0:02:48.08,Main,Thunder Soldier,0,0,0,,禁止人類進入。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.08,0:02:51.65,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,屋子？玩具住在那裡？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.65,0:02:56.59,Main,Thunder Soldier,0,0,0,,說是屋子，其實名不副實。\N裡面沒有床也沒有其他東西。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.59,0:03:00.43,Main,Thunder Soldier,0,0,0,,只有一條通往地下的通道。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.43,0:03:04.73,Main,Thunder Soldier,0,0,0,,每天晚上，玩具們都會走那條通道…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.73,0:03:07.04,Main,Thunder Soldier,0,0,0,,在地下工作一整晚。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.96,0:03:13.10,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,所以鎮上那些玩具才會一直累得半死？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.03,0:03:19.21,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,太慘了！這實在慘得無法用言語形容！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.21,0:03:21.55,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,總、總之…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.55,0:03:25.18,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,佛朗蘭可以從那裡進到SMILE工廠，對吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.18,0:03:29.31,Main,Thunder Soldier,0,0,0,,沒錯。四個方位各有一個入口。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.31,0:03:32.56,Main,Thunder Soldier,0,0,0,,不過，每個入口都戒備森嚴。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.56,0:03:35.17,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,正合我意。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.48,0:03:40.67,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,我到了那裡就大鬧一場！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.68,0:03:43.62,Main,Thunder Soldier,0,0,0,,你、你為什麼要這麼做？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.62,0:03:46.66,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,這樣能替你們省點事，對吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.66,0:03:47.52,Main,Thunder Soldier,0,0,0,,你的意思是…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.52,0:03:52.91,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,趁我引開他們的時候，你們去解決砂糖！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.54,0:04:04.92,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,那傢伙是誰？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.82,0:04:06.99,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,泳褲？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.99,0:04:08.83,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,{\i1}你的頭是怎麼回事？！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.33,0:04:11.53,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,那是武器嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.53,0:04:12.96,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,還是說他只是個笨蛋？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.43,0:04:17.25,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,喂，你看他那分岔的下巴！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.83,0:04:23.96,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,錯不了！\N那是草帽海賊團的改造人佛朗基！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.22,0:04:35.46,Main,Woman,0,0,0,,先生！您不該就這樣把番茄整顆塞進嘴裡。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.46,0:04:37.54,Main,Woman,0,0,0,,會把臉弄得一團糟的！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.97,0:04:50.27,Main,Woman,0,0,0,,噢，他好…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.84,0:04:54.88,Main,Woman,0,0,0,,冷酷！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.88,0:04:58.10,Main,Pink,0,0,100,,{\an8\pos(640,100)}別黏著我，小妹妹們。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.46,0:05:02.25,Captions,Caption,0,0,200,,{\an8\pos(640,210)\fad(504,0)}多佛朗明哥家族（帝雅曼鐵軍{\fnA}♦ {\r}幹部）\N粉紅先生
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.29,0:05:02.25,Main,Pink,0,0,100,,{\an8\pos(640,100)}去找個年輕點的男人吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.25,0:05:04.12,Main,Woman,0,0,0,,噢不，粉紅先生！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.12,0:05:06.62,Main,Woman,0,0,0,,別這麼冷淡嘛，粉紅先生！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.58,0:05:10.46,Main,Señor,0,0,0,,你們這些小丫頭…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.82,0:05:13.83,Main,Señor,0,0,0,,不是我的菜。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.84,0:05:16.70,Main,Woman,0,0,0,,{\i1}粉紅先生！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.70,0:05:18.72,Main,Woman,0,0,0,,別丟下我，粉紅先生！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.72,0:05:20.67,Main,Woman,0,0,0,,{\i1}粉紅先生！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.67,0:05:22.91,Main,Woman,0,0,0,,{\i1}粉紅先生！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.54,0:05:27.31,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,那個變態是怎麼回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.31,0:05:29.07,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,{\i1}你也沒資格說別人！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.07,0:05:32.10,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,玩具屋東側入口呼叫！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.10,0:05:33.35,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,其中一個出現在這裡！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.84,0:05:36.65,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,你們會讓我進去的。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.08,0:05:39.62,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}左武器！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.26,0:05:45.59,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,開火！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.86,0:05:50.43,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,是草帽海賊團的一員！是改造人佛朗基！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.43,0:05:52.60,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}狂風…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.47,0:05:55.32,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}疾襲！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.74,0:06:11.68,Main,Doflamingo,0,0,0,,看看那副景象。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.68,0:06:15.07,Main,Doflamingo,0,0,0,,那些蠢貨已經開始撒野了。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.07,0:06:20.04,Main,Doflamingo,0,0,0,,協助世界政府的加盟國，是你的工作吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.44,0:06:27.53,Main,Diamante,0,0,0,,所以他們已經動手了？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.81,0:06:45.44,Main,Sugar,0,0,0,,玩具屋遭到攻擊。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.25,0:06:48.57,Main,Trébol,0,0,0,,別擔心！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.57,0:06:52.90,Main,Trébol,0,0,0,,草帽一夥的目標是SMILE工廠。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.90,0:06:56.09,Main,Trébol,0,0,0,,就算他們打到這裡…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.09,0:07:00.73,Main,Trébol,0,0,0,,你只要把他們全變成玩具就行了！對吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.21,0:07:05.52,Main,Trébol,0,0,0,,沒人知道！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.52,0:07:10.54,Main,Trébol,0,0,0,,沒人知道你的存在！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.68,0:07:12.90,Main,Sugar,0,0,0,,你說得對。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.38,0:07:18.18,Captions,,0,0,100,,{\an8\pos(640,100)\fad(506,0)}地下通道
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.60,0:07:21.42,Main,Thunder Soldier,0,0,0,,我們快到交易港了。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.42,0:07:25.96,Main,Gnome,0,0,0,,隊長！佛朗蘭已經在玩具屋那邊發動攻擊了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.96,0:07:27.04,Main,Thunder Soldier,0,0,0,,原來如此。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.21,0:07:31.63,Flashbacks,Franky,0,0,0,,我到了那裡就大鬧一場！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.63,0:07:33.53,Main,Thunder Soldier,0,0,0,,希望他沒事。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.53,0:07:37.14,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,不用擔心！他可是超級改造人！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.14,0:07:43.27,Main,Thunder Soldier,0,0,0,,我剛收到消息，家族有四名幹部在守衛玩具屋。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.27,0:07:44.58,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,幹、幹部？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.58,0:07:47.60,Main,Gnome,0,0,0,,偏偏是帝雅曼鐵軍！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.60,0:07:49.75,Main,Gnome,0,0,0,,他們都是武術家。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.75,0:07:51.98,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,他們很強，對吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.98,0:07:55.10,Main,Gnome,0,0,0,,他們在鬥技場比賽的勝率是百分之百。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.10,0:07:57.29,Main,Gnome,0,0,0,,他們是鬥技場最偉大的英雄。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.29,0:07:59.41,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,百分之百？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.41,0:08:01.79,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,你是說他們從沒輸過？！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.52,0:08:04.88,Main,Thunder Soldier,0,0,0,,沒錯。換句話說，
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.20,0:08:10.13,Main,Thunder Soldier,0,0,0,,沒有人知道他們實力的全貌！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.01,0:08:18.34,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,雷奧，敵方的精銳部隊有多龐大？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.34,0:08:24.78,Main,Leo,0,0,0,,十名幹部統領著散布在這片土地上的兩千名手下。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.78,0:08:28.89,Main,Leo,0,0,0,,而這十名幹部又聽命於三名精銳幹部。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.89,0:08:32.94,Main,Leo,0,0,0,,每人各自統領一支專門的軍隊。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.35,0:08:36.56,Main,Leo,0,0,0,,首先是托雷波爾軍。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.56,0:08:38.88,Main,Leo,0,0,0,,他們是特殊能力隊。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.09,0:08:39.01,Captions,Caption,0,0,100,,{\an8\pos(640,100)\fs(45)\fad(519,227)}托雷波爾軍（特殊能力隊）
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.37,0:08:41.25,Main,Leo,0,0,0,,砂糖！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.20,0:08:43.45,Captions,Caption,0,0,100,,{\an8\pos(640,100)\fs(45)\fad(491,246)}砂糖
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.33,0:08:45.85,Main,Leo,0,0,0,,薇歐蕾特！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.70,0:08:47.96,Captions,Caption,0,0,100,,{\an8\pos(640,100)\fs(45)\fad(491,210)}薇歐蕾特
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.38,0:08:50.70,Main,Leo,0,0,0,,喬菈！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.20,0:08:52.49,Captions,Caption,0,0,100,,{\an8\pos(640,100)\fs(45)\fad(491,194)}喬菈
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.62,0:08:57.06,Main,Leo,0,0,0,,接下來是帝雅曼鐵軍。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.06,0:08:59.39,Main,Leo,0,0,0,,他們都是武術家。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.74,0:08:59.60,Captions,Caption,0,0,100,,{\an8\pos(640,100)\fs(45)\fad(500,227)}帝雅曼鐵軍（戰鬥旅團）
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.52,0:09:02.64,Main,Leo,0,0,0,,拉歐·G！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.82,0:09:03.74,Captions,Caption,0,0,100,,{\an8\pos(640,100)\fs(45)\fad(491,200)}拉歐·G
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.36,0:09:06.63,Main,Leo,0,0,0,,馬赫拜茲！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.89,0:09:07.68,Captions,Caption,0,0,100,,{\an8\pos(640,100)\fs(45)\fad(491,200)}馬赫拜茲
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.06,0:09:10.58,Main,Leo,0,0,0,,粉紅先生！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.86,0:09:11.81,Captions,Caption,0,0,100,,{\an8\pos(640,100)\fs(45)\fad(491,200)}粉紅先生
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.61,0:09:15.00,Main,Leo,0,0,0,,德林傑！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.00,0:09:15.95,Captions,Caption,0,0,100,,{\an8\pos(640,100)\fs(45)\fad(451,220)}德林傑
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.87,0:09:19.87,Main,Leo,0,0,0,,最後是皮卡軍。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.65,0:09:22.80,Main,Leo,0,0,0,,他們是突擊部隊！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.97,0:09:24.66,Captions,Caption,0,0,100,,{\an8\pos(650,100)\fs(45)\fad(520,227)}皮卡軍（特殊行動隊）
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.32,0:09:27.58,Main,Leo,0,0,0,,古拉迪斯！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.80,0:09:28.76,Captions,Caption,0,0,100,,{\an8\pos(640,100)\fs(45)\fad(471,200)}古拉迪斯
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.29,0:09:32.38,Main,Leo,0,0,0,,巴法羅和貝比5！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.28,0:09:33.73,Captions,Caption,0,0,200,,{\an8\pos(640,100)\fs(45)\fad(518,180)}巴法羅\N貝比5
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.50,0:09:41.48,Main,Leo,0,0,0,,我們還確認到另外兩名目前不在國內的人。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.78,0:09:45.78,Main,Leo,0,0,0,,精銳幹部維爾戈。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.79,0:09:45.78,Captions,Caption,0,0,100,,{\an8\pos(640,100)\fs(45)\fad(218,0)}精銳幹部維爾戈
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.36,0:09:48.68,Main,Leo,0,0,0,,以及幹部莫內。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.36,0:09:49.50,Captions,Caption,0,0,100,,{\an8\pos(640,100)\fs(45)\fad(218,0)}幹部莫內
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.73,0:09:53.09,Thoughts,Usopp,0,0,0,,那我們就不用擔心那些武術家了！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.09,0:09:54.61,Thoughts,Usopp,0,0,0,,撐住啊，佛朗基！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.61,0:09:57.01,Main,Leo,0,0,0,,他們都很強。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.01,0:09:59.31,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,你在開玩笑吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.07,0:10:09.22,Main,Leo,0,0,0,,對不起，騙人蘭！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.70,0:10:11.55,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,謝謝。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.55,0:10:12.87,Main,Gancho,0,0,0,,別客氣。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.38,0:10:18.53,Main,Leo,0,0,0,,到了。這裡就是地下世界，交易港和工廠的所在地。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.37,0:10:22.87,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,出乎意料地吵。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.91,0:10:27.67,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,是地面的聲音傳下來了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.67,0:10:30.71,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,喂，是誰把貨物弄掉的？！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.71,0:10:32.64,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,這個玩具被壓在下面了。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.64,0:10:34.60,Main,Toy,0,0,0,,對、對不起！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.60,0:10:38.25,Main,Toy,0,0,0,,我會更努力工作，所以請讓我見見我的家人！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.25,0:10:41.99,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,蠢貨！凡是達不到標準的，通通直接送去廢料場！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.99,0:10:42.90,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,把他帶走！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.90,0:10:46.30,Main,Toy,0,0,0,,等、等一下！我還能工作！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.30,0:10:48.35,Main,Toy,0,0,0,,救命！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.75,0:10:50.66,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,騙人布。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.58,0:10:54.70,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,羅賓，你是不是…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.23,0:10:58.02,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,你看。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.70,0:11:05.44,Main,Toy,0,0,0,,我還能工作！救命！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.44,0:11:08.76,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,你要是這麼小氣，我就取消我們的交易！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.76,0:11:11.44,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,混蛋，你這是在剝削我！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.44,0:11:13.69,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,要不是你有喬卡撐腰，我絕對…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.62,0:11:25.60,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,這是什麼情況？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.60,0:11:28.65,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,這根本是一座完整的港口城鎮！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.73,0:11:40.91,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,蘇萊曼對蕾貝卡展開攻擊！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.91,0:11:42.83,Main,Audience,0,0,0,,上啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.83,0:11:44.58,Main,Audience,0,0,0,,去死吧，蕾貝卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.74,0:11:48.34,Main,Audience,0,0,0,,蘇萊曼，砍下她的頭！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.62,0:11:56.09,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,他曾是迪亞斯海戰的英雄，如今卻被通緝為戰犯。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.09,0:12:00.06,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,他是令人聞風喪膽的地下世界殺手！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.58,0:12:07.44,Main,Announcer,0,0,4,,他舉手投足間都像個毫無生氣的幽靈。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.26,0:12:07.92,Captions,,0,0,200,,{\an8\pos(640,100)\fad(525,525)}「迪亞斯海戰」A級戰犯\N斬首者蘇萊曼
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.68,0:12:13.13,Main,Suleiman,0,0,0,,我為國家做了一切。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.13,0:12:14.72,Main,Suleiman,0,0,0,,我深愛我的故鄉。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.71,0:12:18.85,Main,Suleiman,0,0,0,,那你呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.95,0:12:28.66,Main,Suleiman,0,0,0,,被一群鄙視你的人包圍著生活，一定很難熬吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.96,0:12:32.43,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,我不在乎有多難熬。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.43,0:12:35.43,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,我不在乎誰恨我。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.70,0:12:39.28,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,我想和士兵先生一起活下去！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.64,0:12:42.76,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,她就是不肯死！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.76,0:12:49.18,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,包括可恨的蕾貝卡在內，D區還剩下約三十人！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.68,0:12:53.66,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,又有一個人出局了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.66,0:12:55.42,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,我是說一頭動物！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.17,0:12:58.40,Main,Announcer,0,0,4,,牠已經殺了幾十個人，
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.78,0:13:01.84,Captions,,0,0,200,,{\an8\pos(640,100)\fad(525,525)}冒險家 約瑪利亞大船團\N歐隆拜斯
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.40,0:13:00.01,Main,Announcer,0,0,4,,把整個鬥技場染成一片血紅！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.01,0:13:03.49,Main,Announcer,0,0,4,,鬥技場的獅子阿吉歐，剛剛…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.90,0:13:07.57,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,倒在了歐隆拜斯的鞭下。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.49,0:13:14.25,Main,Audience,0,0,0,,他很強。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.25,0:13:15.57,Main,Audience,0,0,0,,提督！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.64,0:13:18.81,Captions,,0,0,100,,{\an8\pos(640,100)\fad(525,0)}海賊 卡文迪許
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.88,0:13:22.11,Captions,,0,0,200,,{\an8\pos(640,100)\fad(525,0)}火焰惡魔\N達馬斯克
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.26,0:13:18.81,Main,Announcer,0,0,4,,會是熱門選手獲勝嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.81,0:13:22.11,Main,Announcer,0,0,4,,還是會殺出一匹黑馬？！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.11,0:13:25.92,Main,Announcer,0,0,4,,這是決賽前的最後一戰！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.18,0:13:25.92,Captions,,0,0,200,,{\an8\pos(640,100)\fad(525,0)}巫醫\N木乃伊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.92,0:13:28.42,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,究竟誰能取下…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.43,0:13:32.86,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,利克國王孫女的首級？！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.42,0:13:37.40,Thoughts,Rebecca,0,0,0,,士兵先生，你現在在哪裡？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.72,0:13:39.23,Thoughts,Rebecca,0,0,0,,請你千萬別死。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.23,0:13:41.36,Thoughts,Rebecca,0,0,0,,我只求這一件事。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.41,0:13:47.34,Captions,,0,0,100,,{\an8\pos(640,100)\fad(525,0)}德雷斯羅薩地下 地下交易港
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.79,0:14:02.59,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,士兵不見了？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.59,0:14:03.82,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,他不是隊長嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.17,0:14:13.00,Main,Leo,0,0,0,,隊長身負重任，要在SOP作戰成功的瞬間殺掉多佛朗明哥。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.00,0:14:17.46,Main,Leo,0,0,0,,他帶了幾個頓達塔族人往王宮去了。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.46,0:14:19.24,Main,Dwarf,0,0,0,,祝你好運，隊長！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.24,0:14:21.57,Main,Dwarf,0,0,0,,{\i1}好！{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.12,0:14:25.81,Main,Leo,0,0,0,,我們有英雄騙人蘭與我們同在。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.81,0:14:31.37,Main,Leo,0,0,0,,騙人蘭，請你領導SOP作戰，幫我們把砂糖擊昏。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.59,0:14:44.10,Thoughts,Usopp,0,0,0,,那不是最重要的工作嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.89,0:14:50.86,Main,Leo,0,0,0,,我們現在就在這裡。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.42,0:14:55.64,OP_665_Signs,,0,500,80,,{\move(324,706,393,662,5,1474)}托雷波爾
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.42,0:14:55.64,OP_665_Signs,,0,500,80,,{\move(634,724,631,662,5,1307)}砂糖
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.89,0:14:55.64,Captions,,0,500,100,,{\an8\pos(640,100)}幹部之塔
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.83,0:14:54.11,Main,Leo,0,0,100,,{\an8\pos(640,100)}所有的橋都是可移動的。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.82,0:14:55.64,OP_665_Signs,,0,500,80,,{\move(236,96,343,156,5,2107)}升降機
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.52,0:14:55.64,Captions,,0,500,100,,{\an8\pos(640,210)}工廠
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.52,0:14:55.64,Captions,,0,500,200,,{\an8\pos(640,320)}地下\N通道
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.64,0:14:58.56,Main,Leo,0,0,0,,而遠處那座建築物…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.45,0:15:03.51,Main,Leo,0,0,0,,那座看起來像海葵的…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.34,0:15:06.35,Main,Leo,0,0,0,,那就是幹部之塔。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.35,0:15:08.62,Main,Leo,0,0,0,,砂糖就在那裡。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.91,0:15:16.25,Main,Grunt,0,0,0,,喂，是誰在那邊偷懶？！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.66,0:15:21.08,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,被他們發現了！完蛋了！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.08,0:15:24.20,Main,Grunt,0,0,0,,你們是哪艘船上的？！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.20,0:15:28.10,Main,Grunt,0,0,0,,不，等等，我只是路過！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.10,0:15:32.68,Main,Grunt,0,0,0,,只有交涉人員才能下船。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.68,0:15:33.91,Main,Leo,0,0,0,,因海爾。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.91,0:15:34.65,Main,Inhel,0,0,0,,明白。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.54,0:15:46.62,Main,Grunt,0,0,0,,妖精出現了！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.62,0:15:48.38,Main,Grunt,0,0,0,,{\i1}他們把我們扒得精光！{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.57,0:15:50.40,Main,Leo & Inhel,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}頓達塔戰鬥！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.85,0:15:52.60,Main,Leo & Inhel,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}尾錘！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.77,0:16:00.37,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,他、他們被埋進地裡了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.93,0:16:03.67,Main,Cotton,0,0,0,,換上這些，騙人蘭、羅賓蘭。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.03,0:16:07.69,Main,Flapper,0,0,0,,我不得不說，你們反應真快。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.69,0:16:10.83,Main,Flapper,0,0,0,,假裝害怕來分散敵人的注意力…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.37,0:16:17.63,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,說起來，你們每個人都有這種本事嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.63,0:16:19.26,Main,Flapper,0,0,0,,是的，我們每個人都做得到這種程度。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.44,0:16:23.87,Main,Leo,0,0,0,,不過諾蘭德的族人可是能殺死海王類。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.87,0:16:25.26,Main,Leo,0,0,0,,我們根本比不上。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.21,0:16:31.20,Thoughts,Usopp,0,0,0,,這些傢伙到底把我當成什麼怪物了？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.80,0:16:38.94,Thoughts,Usopp,0,0,0,,不過我或許不用打就能贏。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.94,0:16:43.05,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,好了各位，就由我騙人蘭來指揮！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.05,0:16:44.92,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,我們的對手是個小女孩！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.27,0:16:48.19,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,我們一起圍上去嚇唬她！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.19,0:16:49.59,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,跟我來！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.59,0:16:51.22,Main,Dwarves,0,0,0,,遵命！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.22,0:16:54.51,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,噢…不…等等…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.51,0:16:56.26,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,你們先走吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.26,0:16:59.36,Main,Dwarves,0,0,0,,{\i1}好！{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.36,0:17:02.17,Main,Leo,0,0,0,,我們往幹部之塔前進！
