Dialogue: 1,0:17:02.17,0:17:05.87,OP_665_Signs,Top left caption,0,0,0,,{\pos(225.143,190)\blur0.5}王宮
Dialogue: 1,0:17:02.17,0:17:05.87,OP_665_Signs,Middle left caption,0,0,0,,{\pos(207,410)\blur0.5}玩具\N屋
