Dialogue: 1,0:17:02.17,0:17:05.87,OP_665_Signs,Bottom right caption,0,0,0,,{\pos(1069.714,566)\blur0.5}升降機交會處
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.34,0:17:05.87,Captions,,0,0,200,,{\an8\pos(898,100)\fad(580,0)\fs40}王宮、玩具屋、交易港、\N幹部之塔與升降機交會處配置圖
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.23,0:17:08.19,Main,Grunt,0,0,0,,快點上來！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.19,0:17:11.08,Main,Grunt,0,0,0,,玩具屋有入侵者！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.08,0:17:14.04,Main,Grunt,0,0,0,,草帽海賊團出現了。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.04,0:17:18.06,Main,Grunt,0,0,0,,他們正在東側入口和粉紅先生大人交戰。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.06,0:17:20.89,Main,Grunt,0,0,0,,他們的目標是下面這座工廠。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.89,0:17:22.65,Main,Thunder Soldier,0,0,0,,佛朗蘭…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.65,0:17:25.56,Main,Grunt,0,0,0,,我聽說擊倒他們可以拿到獎金。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.56,0:17:28.03,Main,Grunt,0,0,0,,真的嗎？多少？！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.03,0:17:30.63,Main,Grunt,0,0,0,,獎賞應該很可觀。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.73,0:17:30.09,Secondary,Fodder,0,0,0,,我們上去吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.63,0:17:31.84,Main,Grunt,0,0,0,,真的？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.84,0:17:33.05,Main,Grunt,0,0,0,,是傳聞啦。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.99,0:17:37.13,Main,Grunt,0,0,0,,話說回來，你這消息是從哪聽來的？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.13,0:17:51.87,Main,Thunder Soldier,0,0,0,,照這樣下去，我們只會一直在玩具屋和地下之間來回。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.37,0:17:54.05,Main,Thunder Soldier,0,0,0,,我們把升降機搶過來吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.74,0:17:56.65,Main,Thunder Soldier,0,0,0,,你們在這裡等著。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.49,0:18:01.82,Main,Thunder Soldier,0,0,0,,立刻投降。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.82,0:18:03.79,Main,Thunder Soldier,0,0,0,,這台升降機我接管了。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.79,0:18:04.81,Main,Grunt,0,0,0,,這傢伙是…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.81,0:18:06.86,Main,Grunt,0,0,0,,鬥技場的雷鬼士兵！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.86,0:18:08.03,Main,Grunt,0,0,0,,他怎麼會到這裡來？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.63,0:18:09.17,Main,Grunt,0,0,0,,他閃開了！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.17,0:18:10.12,Main,Thunder Soldier,0,0,0,,你太慢了！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.40,0:18:13.77,Main,Grunt,0,0,0,,可惡！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.67,0:18:18.34,Main,Thunder Soldier,0,0,0,,你太慢了！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.75,0:18:21.75,Main,Thunder Soldier,0,0,0,,你太慢了！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.92,0:18:26.44,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,士兵先生打我！這是家庭暴力！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.44,0:18:28.12,Main,Thunder Soldier,0,0,0,,才不是！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.12,0:18:30.60,Main,Thunder Soldier,0,0,0,,我不想打你！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.21,0:18:33.32,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,那就在打到我之前住手！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.32,0:18:36.68,Main,Thunder Soldier,0,0,0,,沒有危險你就不會成長！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.68,0:18:39.14,Main,Thunder Soldier,0,0,0,,集中精神，蕾貝卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.64,0:18:46.93,Main,Thunder Soldier,0,0,0,,人的本能遠比你想像的還要強大！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.93,0:18:48.96,Main,Thunder Soldier,0,0,0,,把它們激發出來！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.96,0:18:51.27,Main,Thunder Soldier,0,0,0,,相信人類的力量！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.27,0:18:54.31,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,可是你是玩具啊，士兵先生！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.90,0:18:56.64,Main,Thunder Soldier,0,0,0,,別發牢騷了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.24,0:19:04.26,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,我不想再學怎麼戰鬥了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.72,0:19:10.16,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,為什麼你不能一直保護我？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.48,0:19:12.80,Main,Thunder Soldier,0,0,0,,我是個玩具。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.80,0:19:16.57,Main,Thunder Soldier,0,0,0,,一旦淋到雨或吹到風，我就會生鏽。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.93,0:19:24.19,Main,Thunder Soldier,0,0,0,,我不知道我的身體什麼時候會撐到極限。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.31,0:19:28.48,Main,Thunder Soldier,0,0,0,,站起來，蕾貝卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.80,0:19:31.46,Main,Thunder Soldier,0,0,0,,變強！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.44,0:19:39.68,Thoughts,Thunder Soldier,0,0,0,,我的身體天生就不是用來戰鬥的。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.22,0:19:44.60,Thoughts,Thunder Soldier,0,0,0,,或許玩具注定…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.60,0:19:47.63,Thoughts,Thunder Soldier,0,0,0,,要在孩子長大成人之前就壞掉。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.58,0:19:53.12,Thoughts,Thunder Soldier,0,0,0,,原諒我，蕾貝卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.02,0:20:02.46,Thoughts,Thunder Soldier,0,0,0,,你笨拙的父親，只教得了你如何戰鬥。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.60,0:20:07.45,Main,Grunt,0,0,0,,他一直都這麼強嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.45,0:20:09.11,Main,Grunt,0,0,0,,你到底想要什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.11,0:20:11.57,Main,Grunt,0,0,0,,你這樣一個玩具，能想要什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.83,0:20:15.04,Main,Thunder Soldier,0,0,0,,我想要一個和平的國家…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.04,0:20:17.74,Main,Thunder Soldier,0,0,0,,一個能讓我女兒幸福的國家！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.04,0:20:22.93,Main,Thunder Soldier,0,0,0,,我要讓你把德雷斯羅薩還給利克王族！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.34,0:20:25.71,Main,Grunt,0,0,0,,利克國王？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.71,0:20:27.89,Main,Grunt,0,0,0,,你在胡說八道些什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.88,0:20:32.39,Thoughts,Thunder Soldier,0,0,0,,為了那個目標，我甘願獻出生命。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.99,0:20:43.45,Captions,,0,0,100,,{\an8\pos(640,100)}鬥牛鬥技場
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.75,0:20:46.02,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,剛剛發生什麼事了？！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.68,0:20:49.13,Main,Sabo,0,0,0,,好快。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.13,0:20:51.48,Main,Bartolomeo,0,0,0,,搞什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.48,0:20:53.03,Main,Bartolomeo,0,0,0,,我什麼都沒看到。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.92,0:20:55.95,Main,Sabo,0,0,0,,我早聽過那些傳聞，可是…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.90,0:21:02.16,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,天啊，大家全都倒下了！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.94,0:21:11.62,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,D區的倖存者全都倒下了，而且不知為何，沒有一個站得起來！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.00,0:21:16.25,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,這是真的嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.25,0:21:20.72,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,對D區的突襲在一瞬間就結束了！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.86,0:21:28.00,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,不，等等！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.20,0:21:32.80,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,有人正試著站起來！
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main,,0,0,0,,

